  << /ActualText (Product design leader with 9\053 years of experience across enterprise SaaS\054 analytics\054 technical products and AI\055native products\056 Experienced setting design direction across multiple product teams\054 establishing information architecture and design processes\054 mentoring designers\054 interviewing and hiring design talent\054 and working closely with Product\054 Engineering and business leaders\056 Combines customer discovery and product thinking with hands\055on design execution\054 especially in complex enterprise workflows\056 Led design direction across multiple Whatfix product areas\054 coordinating work across teams and mentoring designers\056 Helped scale the Whatfix design organization toward 20\053 designers by interviewing incoming designers\054 including leadership candidates\054 and participating in design reviews and mentoring\056\015Initiated and led an organization\055wide Information Architecture Charter to establish a scalable navigation and content structure across enterprise products\056\015 Established reusable UX principles and interaction patterns to improve consistency across product teams\056\015Worked closely with Product\054 Engineering and Research to align customer needs\054 product goals\054 technical constraints and design decisions\056\015)
